<title>USA: District of Columbia $234 mln GOs won by Lehman.</title>
<headline>District of Columbia $234 mln GOs won by Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it won $233.9 million District of Columbia general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 6.0734 percent.</p>
</text>
